; medium TRAP: NULLEQ join; customers.c_region and suppliers.s_region are nullable and NULL pairs with NULL here. Dropping NULLEQ, or a GROUP-based rewrite without it, is wrong. Late filter on s_rating
LOAD   cr, customers.c_region
LOAD   cn, customers.c_name
LOAD   sr, suppliers.s_region
LOAD   sn, suppliers.s_name
LOAD   rt, suppliers.s_rating
HJOIN  li, ri, cr, sr, NULLEQ
GATHER a, cn, li
GATHER b, sn, ri
GATHER c, rt, ri
GATHER d, cr, li
GE     m, c, 2
IDX    i, m
GATHER a2, a, i
GATHER b2, b, i
GATHER d2, d, i
OUT    a2, b2, d2
